Because you have self-employment income ($15,000 from web design), you can claim the home office deduction against your business income. (You cannot claim a home office for your W-2 job).
You have two ways to calculate this:
*   **Simplified Method:** $5 per square foot up to 300 sq ft. (130 sq ft × $5 = **$650 deduction**).
